# API Reference

Complete API reference for the Fanbasis Payment SDK, including all methods, properties, and types.

## Core SDK API

### PaymentCheckout

The main class for creating and managing checkout instances.

```
```
import { PaymentCheckout } from '@fanbasis/checkout-core';
```
```

#### Static Methods

* ```
  PaymentCheckout.create(config: CheckoutConfig): PaymentCheckout
  ```

  - Create a new checkout instance
* ```
  PaymentCheckout.fromElement(element: HTMLElement, config: CheckoutConfig): PaymentCheckout
  ```

  - Create and attach to a DOM element in one call

#### Instance Methods

* ```
  attachToElement(element: HTMLElement): void
  ```

  - Attach checkout to a DOM element
* ```
  init(): Promise<void>
  ```

  - Initialize and open the checkout
* ```
  destroy(): void
  ```

  - Close the checkout and remove the iframe
* ```
  cleanup(): void
  ```

  - Fully clean up the checkout instance (destroy + remove all listeners)
* ```
  getState(): CheckoutState
  ```

  - Get current checkout state
* ```
  updateConfig(config: Partial<CheckoutConfig>): void
  ```

  - Update configuration
* ```
  updateTheme(theme: CustomizationParams): void
  ```

  - Update theme configuration
* ```
  on(event: string, callback: Function): void
  ```

  - Listen to events
* ```
  off(event: string, callback: Function): void
  ```

  - Remove event listeners

#### Programmatic Form Submission

* ```
  submitForm(options?: SubmitFormOptions): void
  ```

  - Programmatically submit the payment form
* ```
  isFormReady(): boolean
  ```

  - Check if the form is ready for submission

#### Addon Methods

* ```
  addAddon(addonId: string): void
  ```

  - Select an addon
* ```
  removeAddon(addonId: string): void
  ```

  - Deselect an addon
* ```
  toggleAddon(addonId: string): void
  ```

  - Toggle an addon's selection state

#### Coupon Methods

Apply or remove a discount code at runtime — useful when the in-iframe coupon row is hidden (e.g.

```
show_product_info: false
```

) and you render your own coupon input on the parent page.

* ```
  applyCoupon(code: string): void
  ```

  - Apply a coupon code (throws

  ```
  PaymentError
  ```

  if code is empty)
* ```
  removeCoupon(): void
  ```

  - Clear any applied coupon

Listen for

```
coupon:applied
```

and

```
coupon:error
```

to react to the iframe's validation result.

#### Field Getter/Setter Methods

These methods allow programmatic control of billing form fields. Setters validate input before sending. Getters return the current field value from the iframe via

```
postMessage
```

.

* ```
  setEmail(value: string): Promise<void>
  ```

  - Set the email field (validates email format)
* ```
  getEmail(): Promise<string | null>
  ```

  - Get the current email value
* ```
  setFirstName(value: string): Promise<void>
  ```

  - Set first name (cannot be empty)
* ```
  getFirstName(): Promise<string | null>
  ```

  - Get the current first name
* ```
  setLastName(value: string): Promise<void>
  ```

  - Set last name (cannot be empty)
* ```
  getLastName(): Promise<string | null>
  ```

  - Get the current last name
* ```
  setPhone(value: string): Promise<void>
  ```

  - Set phone (validates phone format)
* ```
  getPhone(): Promise<string | null>
  ```

  - Get the current phone value
* ```
  setAddress(value: PrefillAddress): Promise<void>
  ```

  - Set address (only when

  ```
  fields.address.hide
  ```

  is true)
* ```
  getAddress(): Promise<PrefillAddress | null>
  ```

  - Get the current address

### CheckoutConfig Interface

```
```
interface CheckoutConfig {
  // Required fields
  creatorId: string;
  productId: string;
  checkoutSessionSecret: string;
  environment: 'sandbox' | 'production';

  // Optional fields
  theme?: CustomizationParams;
  containerOptions?: ContainerOptions;
  redirectSettings?: RedirectSettings;

  // Product options
  bumpProductIds?: string[];
  couponCode?: string;
  affiliateCode?: string;
  showAllAddons?: boolean;

  // Advanced
  metadata?: Record<string, string>;
  showSubmitButton?: boolean;
  overrideBaseUrl?: string;
}
```
```

### CustomizationParams Interface

```
```
interface CustomizationParams {
  // Theme options
  theme: 'light' | 'dark';
  accent_color: string;
  show_product_info: boolean;
  product_layout: 'left' | 'above';
  show_coupon_row: boolean;
  coupon_row_disclaimer?: string; 

  // Optional color overrides
  background_color?: string;
  label_color?: string;
  input_background_color?: string;
  product_text_color?: string;
  heading_color?: string;
  secondary_color?: string;
  border_color?: string;
  surface_color?: string;

  // Layout options
  billing_form_placement?: 'above' | 'left';
  show_headings?: boolean;
  show_powered_by?: boolean;

  // Field visibility (deprecated — use fields instead)
  billing_display_fields?: string;

  // Prefill & field controls
  prefill?: PrefillConfig;
  fields?: FieldsConfig;
}
```
```

### PrefillConfig & FieldsConfig

```
```
interface PrefillAddress {
  country?: string;
  line1?: string;
  line2?: string;
  city?: string;
  state?: string;
  postal_code?: string;
}

interface PrefillConfig {
  email?: string;
  first_name?: string;
  last_name?: string;
  phone?: string;
  address?: PrefillAddress;
}

interface FieldControl {
  hide?: boolean;
  disable?: boolean;
}

interface FieldsConfig {
  email?: FieldControl;
  first_name?: FieldControl;
  last_name?: FieldControl;
  phone?: FieldControl;
  address?: FieldControl;
}
```
```

### ContainerOptions Interface

```
```
interface ContainerOptions {
  width?: string;
  height?: string;
}
```
```

### RedirectSettings Interface

```
```
interface RedirectSettings {
  success_redirect_url?: string;
  failure_redirect_url?: string;
  always_redirect?: boolean;
}
```
```

## React SDK API

### Components

#### CheckoutProvider

Provides checkout configuration to child components.

```
```
interface CheckoutProviderProps {
  config: CheckoutConfig;
  children: React.ReactNode;
}
```
```

#### AutoCheckout

Automatically handles the checkout flow.

```
```
interface AutoCheckoutProps {
  autoOpen?: boolean;
  onSuccess?: (data: CheckoutSuccessData) => void;
  onError?: (error: PaymentError) => void;
  containerOptions?: ContainerOptions;
  className?: string;
}
```
```

#### Checkout

Provides more control over the checkout display.

```
```
interface CheckoutProps {
  onSuccess?: (data: CheckoutSuccessData) => void;
  onError?: (error: PaymentError) => void;
  containerOptions?: ContainerOptions;
  className?: string;
}
```
```

### Hooks

#### useCheckout

Provides access to the checkout instance and methods.

```
```
interface UseCheckoutReturn {
  // State
  isOpen: boolean;
  isLoading: boolean;
  isInitialized: boolean;
  error: PaymentError | null;

  // Lifecycle
  init: (element?: HTMLElement) => Promise<void>;
  destroy: () => void;
  updateConfig: (config: Partial<CheckoutConfig>) => void;
  attachToElement: (element: HTMLElement) => void;

  // Events
  on: (event: CheckoutEventName, listener: Function) => void;
  off: (event: CheckoutEventName, listener: Function) => void;

  // Form control
  submitForm: (options?: SubmitFormOptions) => void;
  isFormReady: () => boolean;

  // Field getters/setters
  setEmail: (value: string) => Promise<void>;
  getEmail: () => Promise<string | null>;
  setFirstName: (value: string) => Promise<void>;
  getFirstName: () => Promise<string | null>;
  setLastName: (value: string) => Promise<void>;
  getLastName: () => Promise<string | null>;
  setPhone: (value: string) => Promise<void>;
  getPhone: () => Promise<string | null>;
  setAddress: (value: PrefillAddress) => Promise<void>;
  getAddress: () => Promise<PrefillAddress | null>;

  // Raw access
  getCheckout: () => PaymentCheckout | null;
}
```
```

## Events

The SDK emits various events throughout the checkout lifecycle:

### Checkout Events

* ```
  checkout:opened
  ```

  - Emitted when checkout is opened
* ```
  checkout:closed
  ```

  - Emitted when checkout is closed
* ```
  checkout:loaded
  ```

  - Emitted when checkout is loaded and ready
* ```
  checkout:success
  ```

  - Emitted when payment is successful
* ```
  checkout:error
  ```

  - Emitted when an error occurs

### Form Events

* ```
  form:ready
  ```

  - Emitted when the payment form is ready for submission
* ```
  form:submitting
  ```

  - Emitted when the form is being submitted
* ```
  form:submission_error
  ```

  - Emitted when form submission fails

### Addon & Field Events

* ```
  addons:changed
  ```

  - Emitted when addon selection changes
* ```
  field:value
  ```

  - Emitted when a field value is retrieved

### Coupon Events

* ```
  coupon:applied
  ```

  - Emitted on successful coupon application. Payload:

  ```
  { code, discountAmount, newTotal }
  ```
* ```
  coupon:error
  ```

  - Emitted when a coupon is invalid or expired. Payload:

  ```
  { code, error }
  ```

